WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,590 --> 00:00:02,590
Brother Liu, let me bring you whatever ingredients you want.

2
00:00:02,590 --> 00:00:04,200
All very hungry

3
00:00:04,200 --> 00:00:05,200
I'm here to help

4
00:00:05,200 --> 00:00:07,200
Hurry up and let everyone eat

5
00:00:07,200 --> 00:00:09,200
Can you share some grids with everyone?

6
00:00:09,200 --> 00:00:30,050
Able to collect supplies individually

7
00:00:30,050 --> 00:00:31,050
Much faster

8
00:00:31,050 --> 00:00:33,180
Sovereignty stays with me

9
00:00:33,180 --> 00:00:40,460
Only the right to use

10
00:00:40,460 --> 00:00:41,460
Can be mixed

11
00:00:41,460 --> 00:00:43,900
But the same kind cannot be superimposed infinitely.

12
00:00:43,900 --> 00:00:45,900
You can only choose one of the two
